Subject: [PATCH 29/29] fix(web): a jstack home row says its age, and no count
 of crews, scouts, reviews or queued tasks

The home row summed up its open tasks by stage, such as "2 scouts, 5 review, 1 queued", in place
of its age. The user asked for the wording gone. homeSummary, its tally and the tally's group on
each worker go with it, and a home row says its age whether or not tasks are open under it.
